+// Generated by bbport's docs/hdr-tools/bb_composite_model.py, which checks every option set
+// against the game's own code run in a GCN emulator: 1380 of the 1418 reproduced (largest
+// difference 1.9e-02 on a 0..1 output). The other 38 (several scene samples: distortion effects,
+// or not within 0.02) are not listed: they stay the game's own SDR composite. Sorted by hash.
+
+#pragma once
